{"4110140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Harvest Skies: Crop Dusting Simulator", "steam_appid": 4110140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110140/extras/02c53cb98f8a6f08aef02b7df1f1d07e.poster.avif?t=1785337263\" width=960 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110140/extras/02c53cb98f8a6f08aef02b7df1f1d07e.webm?t=1785337263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110140/extras/02c53cb98f8a6f08aef02b7df1f1d07e.mp4?t=1785337263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">FLY LOW, SPRAY STEADY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fifty feet above the crops. Fuel burning, chemicals draining. Cover every inch of the field while dodging power lines, trees, and birds. One mistake and you're walking home - if you're lucky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110140/extras/817e0738aa0b060ad226c1beaedaa6ee.poster.avif?t=1785337263\" width=960 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110140/extras/817e0738aa0b060ad226c1beaedaa6ee.webm?t=1785337263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110140/extras/817e0738aa0b060ad226c1beaedaa6ee.mp4?t=1785337263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">MIX YOUR PAYLOAD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every job needs the right blend. Fertilizer for growth. Pesticides for locusts. Irrigation mixes for dry soil. Buy ingredients, learn the formulas, load the tank. Better chemistry means better results.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110140/extras/926ef2f355d7768f781d5661ba4a80ad.poster.avif?t=1785337263\" width=960 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110140/extras/926ef2f355d7768f781d5661ba4a80ad.webm?t=1785337263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110140/extras/926ef2f355d7768f781d5661ba4a80ad.mp4?t=1785337263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">RUN A BUSINESS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contracts come in daily - small fields, big fields, urgent calls. Check the weather, weigh the costs, pick what pays. Build reputation. Grow your client list. Keep the operation running.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110140/extras/a4f75aa441f4374701163d815367f376.poster.avif?t=1785337263\" width=960 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110140/extras/a4f75aa441f4374701163d815367f376.webm?t=1785337263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110140/extras/a4f75aa441f4374701163d815367f376.mp4?t=1785337263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">GROW YOUR OPERATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your plane. Buy better gear. Expand to new airfields across dry plains, green valleys, coastal farms. Start small. See how far you can take it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110140/extras/e9d23454c6c6301f6e740e17fd035007.poster.avif?t=1785337263\" width=960 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110140/extras/e9d23454c6c6301f6e740e17fd035007.webm?t=1785337263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110140/extras/e9d23454c6c6301f6e740e17fd035007.mp4?t=1785337263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">FLY TOGETHER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends, coordinate your runs, split the pay. Co-op for up to 4 players.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110140/extras/dadf6d645aa2e72cdfd4eab3ebcdaf31.poster.avif?t=1785337263\" width=960 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110140/extras/dadf6d645aa2e72cdfd4eab3ebcdaf31.webm?t=1785337263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110140/extras/dadf6d645aa2e72cdfd4eab3ebcdaf31.mp4?t=1785337263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110140/extras/02c53cb98f8a6f08aef02b7df1f1d07e.poster.avif?t=1785337263\" width=960 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110140/extras/02c53cb98f8a6f08aef02b7df1f1d07e.webm?t=1785337263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110140/extras/02c53cb98f8a6f08aef02b7df1f1d07e.mp4?t=1785337263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">FLY LOW, SPRAY STEADY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fifty feet above the crops. Fuel burning, chemicals draining. Cover every inch of the field while dodging power lines, trees, and birds. One mistake and you're walking home - if you're lucky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110140/extras/817e0738aa0b060ad226c1beaedaa6ee.poster.avif?t=1785337263\" width=960 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110140/extras/817e0738aa0b060ad226c1beaedaa6ee.webm?t=1785337263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110140/extras/817e0738aa0b060ad226c1beaedaa6ee.mp4?t=1785337263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">MIX YOUR PAYLOAD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every job needs the right blend. Fertilizer for growth. Pesticides for locusts. Irrigation mixes for dry soil. Buy ingredients, learn the formulas, load the tank. Better chemistry means better results.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110140/extras/926ef2f355d7768f781d5661ba4a80ad.poster.avif?t=1785337263\" width=960 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110140/extras/926ef2f355d7768f781d5661ba4a80ad.webm?t=1785337263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110140/extras/926ef2f355d7768f781d5661ba4a80ad.mp4?t=1785337263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">RUN A BUSINESS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contracts come in daily - small fields, big fields, urgent calls. Check the weather, weigh the costs, pick what pays. Build reputation. Grow your client list. Keep the operation running.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110140/extras/a4f75aa441f4374701163d815367f376.poster.avif?t=1785337263\" width=960 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110140/extras/a4f75aa441f4374701163d815367f376.webm?t=1785337263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110140/extras/a4f75aa441f4374701163d815367f376.mp4?t=1785337263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">GROW YOUR OPERATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your plane. Buy better gear. Expand to new airfields across dry plains, green valleys, coastal farms. Start small. See how far you can take it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110140/extras/e9d23454c6c6301f6e740e17fd035007.poster.avif?t=1785337263\" width=960 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110140/extras/e9d23454c6c6301f6e740e17fd035007.webm?t=1785337263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110140/extras/e9d23454c6c6301f6e740e17fd035007.mp4?t=1785337263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">FLY TOGETHER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends, coordinate your runs, split the pay. Co-op for up to 4 players.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110140/extras/dadf6d645aa2e72cdfd4eab3ebcdaf31.poster.avif?t=1785337263\" width=960 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110140/extras/dadf6d645aa2e72cdfd4eab3ebcdaf31.webm?t=1785337263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110140/extras/dadf6d645aa2e72cdfd4eab3ebcdaf31.mp4?t=1785337263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Build your crop-dusting empire from a single rusty biplane. Take contracts, mix chemicals, fly through wind and hazards. Then hire pilots, expand to new airfields, and grow your operation. See how far your skills can take you... and your luck.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Ukrainian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110140/434f116393bd29fd04b9b380e5f59dcde3d80230/header.jpg?t=1785337263", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110140/e7c9ea88b869c5d7c737184bd01669c142ef3221/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785337263", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110140/e7c9ea88b869c5d7c737184bd01669c142ef3221/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785337263", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3GHz 4-Core or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1060 or Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space<